IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-INFLIGHT-BATCHING.

DATA DIVISION.
01 QUEUE-DEPTH         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 MAX-CAPACITY        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 ACTIVE-REQS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 EFFICIENCY-X10      PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-INFLIGHT.
    IF MAX-CAPACITY == 0
        MOVE 64 TO MAX-CAPACITY.
    END-IF.

    IF QUEUE-DEPTH < MAX-CAPACITY
        MOVE QUEUE-DEPTH TO ACTIVE-REQS.
    ELSE
        MOVE MAX-CAPACITY TO ACTIVE-REQS.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 21 TO EFFICIENCY-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 ACTIVE-REQS.
    WEIGHT 30 EFFICIENCY-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
